# Density Compare
# Lithium (Li) — real density 0.534 g/cm³. equal masses: Lithium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Lithium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 24.6mm color: #cc80ff at (-20mm, 12.3mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 4.3 g — the water cube is the reference
